{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e11-scene-14",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "把你们的日程协调一下  (Coordinating Both of Your Schedules)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "agent": "经纪人",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "As Chun Yuqiao prepares for an overseas business trip, Xin Huimei's talent manager stops by asking for a copy of Yuqiao's daily calendar because Huimei has cleared half her week hoping to see him. Listen to the manager, Bu Xiaogu, and Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "小谷，淳于总在吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他在。他最近要去美国出差了，我去帮您通报一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我来跟您请示一下，能不能要一份您的工作日程啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "经纪部要我这工作日程干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "惠美一直要求清空所有的日程，现在一周里面有半周她都是空闲的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "当然要尊重她的意思，但是她一向都很敬业，工作上一直都很认真。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "您说得都对，但是她现在谈恋爱了呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "所以我想着如果把你们的日程协调一下，对于工作和生活都有更好的安排。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "小谷，你把他工作日程调出来我记录一下。四月份这么满啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他从美国回来下一个月也都是满的，而且这些时间随时都在变动。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我们随时保持联系，如果淳于总这儿有什么变化，我也让惠美调一下，让他们俩多点时间见面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好嘞，好。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "小谷，淳于总在吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, is Mr Chun Yuqiao in his office?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他在。他最近要去美国出差了，我去帮您通报一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He's inside preparing for his upcoming overseas business trip — let me let him know you're here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我来跟您请示一下，能不能要一份您的工作日程啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I came to ask if I might get a copy of your work schedule.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "经纪部要我这工作日程干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why does the talent management division need my work calendar?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "惠美一直要求清空所有的日程，现在一周里面有半周她都是空闲的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huimei insisted I clear her bookings, so now she leaves half of every week completely open.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "当然要尊重她的意思，但是她一向都很敬业，工作上一直都很认真。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Naturally we respect her wishes, though she has always been thoroughly dedicated to her work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "您说得都对，但是她现在谈恋爱了呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything you say is true — except now she is in love!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "所以我想着如果把你们的日程协调一下，对于工作和生活都有更好的安排。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So I figured coordinating both of your schedules would let you balance work and personal time better.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "小谷，你把他工作日程调出来我记录一下。四月份这么满啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, pull up his calendar so I can jot it down — April is packed this tight?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他从美国回来下一个月也都是满的，而且这些时间随时都在变动。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next month after he returns from abroad is completely full too, and his hours shift constantly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我们随时保持联系，如果淳于总这儿有什么变化，我也让惠美调一下，让他们俩多点时间见面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's stay in touch; whenever his calendar changes, I'll adjust Huimei's so the two of them can meet more.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好嘞，好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sure thing — will do.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "小谷，淳于总在吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他在。他最近要去美国出差了，我去帮您通报一下。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我来跟您请示一下，能不能要一份您的工作日程啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "经纪部要我这工作日程干吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "惠美一直要求清空所有的日程，现在一周里面有半周她都是空闲的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "当然要尊重她的意思，但是她一向都很敬业，工作上一直都很认真。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "您说得都对，但是她现在谈恋爱了呀。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "所以我想着如果把你们的日程协调一下，对于工作和生活都有更好的安排。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "小谷，你把他工作日程调出来我记录一下。四月份这么满啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他从美国回来下一个月也都是满的，而且这些时间随时都在变动。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我们随时保持联系，如果淳于总这儿有什么变化，我也让惠美调一下，让他们俩多点时间见面。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好嘞，好。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Swallowing her heartache with quiet professionalism, Bu Xiaogu pulls up Chun Yuqiao's packed schedule and promises the manager to pass along any updates. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
